msgid "[Simulating backends at the pulse-level](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/tutorials/dynamics_backend.html)\n"
msgstr "[Simulating backends at the pulse-level](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qiskit-dynamics/tutorials/dynamics_backend.html)\n"
